ese terms apply to your order. We may change our terms and conditions at any time, so please do not assume that the same terms will apply to future orders.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;'),('ShopTitle','Shop Home'),('ShortcutMenu','1'),('Show_Settled_LastMonth','1'),('ShowStockidOnImages','0'),('ShowValueOnGRN','1'),('SmtpSetting','0'),('SO_AllowSameItemMultipleTimes','1'),('StandardCostDecimalPlaces','2'),('StockUsageShowZeroWithinPeriodRange','0'),('TaxAuthorityReferenceName',''),('UpdateCurrencyRatesDaily','2025-11-12'),('WeightedAverageCosting','0'),('WikiApp','DokuWiki'),('WikiPath','wiki'),('WorkingDaysWeek','5'),('YearEnd','12'),('CreditReviewIntervalMonths','12'),('LateInterestRate','0'),('ReminderFee','0'),('ReminderText1','Our records show that the invoices listed below are now past their due date. This may simply have crossed with your payment, in which case please disregard this letter. Otherwise we would be grateful to receive payment shortly.'),('ReminderText2','The invoices listed below remain unpaid well beyond their due date. Please arrange payment immediately, or contact us today if there is a query on any of them.'),('ReminderText3','FINAL NOTICE. The invoices listed below are seriously overdue. Unless payment is received without delay we will withhold further supplies and may take steps to recover the debt.');
